{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-08/1063143/block/singleImage/3263888/df/01KZQ0DNDVW6F921T2NJAZ36E9.jpg?updatedAt=1794364530\"/><figcaption>瑪麗醫院。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>中西區海濱長廊西區副食品批發市場段2-3號碼頭間， 今日（11日）早上7時44分，一名男子在中西區海濱長廊西區副食品批發市場段2-3號碼頭對開海面載浮載沉，有途人發現報警求助。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，將該名年約40歲的南亞裔男子救起，惟他已經陷入昏迷，由救護車送往瑪麗醫院搶救，可惜最終不治。警方在場搜索死者的財物，正在調查其身分及墮海原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:51:43.080648+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T02:35:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T17:15:10.429147+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T03:45:10.008600+00:00","content_hash":"9c99b439bc0a4ed51064c8b09365e5470a9e4baea011eff07fbb4497cfbe2277","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:51:43.080648+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}